  "solution": {
    "text": "Dacron is a condensation polymer. It is also known as terylene. It is a polymer obtained by condensation reaction between ethylene glycol and terephthalic acid at $420-460 \\mathrm{K}$ in the presence of zinc acetate-antimony trioxide catalyst.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_che_a65.png\">",
